125615)`** - Runtime async performance\n15. **`Improve HashSet<T> performance by enabling JIT bounds check elimination (#125893)`** - Performance optimization\n16. **`Add VectorXx.Asin and use it to vectorize TensorPrimitives.Asin (#126052)`** - Vector API + TensorPrimitives\n17. **`Sve: Expand CreateWhile APIs (#124081)`** - SVE intrinsics\n18. **`Split Dictionary.Remove inner loops for value-type key optimization (#125884)`** - Dictionary performance\n19. **`JIT: Constant fold SequenceEqual with the help of VN (#121985)`** - JIT optimization\n20. **`TarWriter: when writing entries for the same hard-linked file use HardLink entries (#123874)`** - Tar improvement\n21. **`Add [OverloadResolutionPriority(1)] to MemoryMarshal.AsBytes(Span) and Cast(Span) (#126252)`** - API overload resolution\n\nLooking at more commits from the preview cycle, I see several LINQ and cryptography improvements, a null check bug fix for ImmutableArray, a COM interop fix for unsafe methods, RISC-V runtime support, and a SafeFileHandle performance regression fix. I need to pull in more commits from February-March to get a fuller picture of the preview release.",
